# API Documentation

Swagger digunakan untuk melihat dan mencoba REST API.

Swagger UI:

```text
http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/swagger-ui/index.html
```

Jika URL tersebut tidak tersedia, coba:

```text
http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/swagger-ui.html
```

OpenAPI JSON:

```text
http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/v3/api-docs
```

---

# Authentication

Aplikasi menggunakan JWT untuk autentikasi.

Flow autentikasi:

```text
Register
   │
   ▼
Login
   │
   ▼
Receive JWT Token
   │
   ▼
Send JWT Token
   │
   ▼
Access Protected API
```

JWT dikirim melalui HTTP Header:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
```

---

# Register

Endpoint:

```http
POST /auth/register
```

Full URL:

```text
http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/auth/register
```

Contoh request:

```json
{
  "username": "fajar",
  "email": "fajar@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Contoh menggunakan cURL:

```bash
curl -X POST "http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/auth/register" \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d "{\"username\":\"fajar\",\"email\":\"fajar@example.com\",\"password\":\"password123\"}"
```

---

# Login

Endpoint:

```http
POST /auth/login
```

Full URL:

```text
http://localhost:4110/api/v1/banking/auth/login
```

Contoh request:

```json
{
  "username": "fajar",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Contoh response:

```json
{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
}
```

Gunakan token tersebut untuk mengakses endpoint yang membutuhkan autentikasi.

Header:

```http
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...
```

---

# JWT Configuration

JWT dikonfigurasi menggunakan:

```properties
jwt.secret=YOUR_SECRET_KEY
jwt.expiration=86400000
```

Expiration:

```text
86400000 milliseconds
```

atau:

```text
24 jam
```

Untuk production, gunakan secret key yang aman dan jangan commit secret asli ke repository.

Disarankan menggunakan environment variable:

```properties
jwt.secret=${JWT_SECRET}
```

---

# API Endpoints

## Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Authentication |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register` | No |
| POST | `/auth/login` | No |

## Accounts

| Method | Endpoint | Authentication |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/accounts` | JWT |
| GET | `/accounts/{id}` | JWT |
| POST | `/accounts` | JWT |
| PUT | `/accounts/{id}` | JWT |

## Transactions

| Method | Endpoint | Authentication |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/transactions` | JWT |
| GET | `/transactions/{id}` | JWT |
| POST | `/transactions` | JWT |

## Expenses

| Method | Endpoint | Authentication |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/expenses` | JWT |
| GET | `/expenses/{id}` | JWT |
| POST | `/expenses` | JWT |

## Settlement

| Method | Endpoint | Authentication |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/settlements` | JWT |
| GET | `/settlements/{id}` | JWT |

> Detail endpoint dapat dilihat melalui Swagger UI.

---

# Error Handling

Contoh response error:

```json
{
  "timestamp": "2026-07-25T20:19:04.048+00:00",
  "status": 500,
  "error": "Internal Server Error",
  "message": "Role tidak ditemukan",
  "path": "/api/v1/banking/auth/register"
}
```

Untuk validasi request:

```json
{
  "status": 400,
  "message": "Validation failed"
}
```

