# Git Workflow

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

Masuk ke folder:

```bash
cd mini-banking
```

Buat branch:

```bash
git checkout -b feature/your-feature
```

Commit:

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "feat: add banking backend"
```

Push:

```bash
git push origin feature/your-feature
```

