# Security Notes

Jangan commit credential asli ke GitHub.

Hindari menyimpan:

```properties
spring.datasource.password=real-password
jwt.secret=real-secret
```

Gunakan environment variable untuk production.

Contoh:

```properties
spring.datasource.password=${DB_PASSWORD}
jwt.secret=${JWT_SECRET}
```

